// Title: TeamViewer Remote Session
// Sigma ID: 162ab1e4-6874-4564-853c-53ec3ab8be01
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-01-30 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: command-and-control, T1219.002
// Description: Detects the creation of log files during a TeamViewer remote session
// False positives:
//   - Legitimate uses of TeamViewer in an organisation
// References:
//   - https://www.teamviewer.com/en-us/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_susp_teamviewer_remote_session.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceFileEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "\\TeamViewer\\RemotePrinting\\tvprint.db" or FolderPath endswith "\\TeamViewer\\TVNetwork.log") or (FolderPath contains "\\TeamViewer" and FolderPath contains "_Logfile.log")
